   <message name="IDS_OMNIBOX_PEDAL_RUN_CHROME_SAFETY_CHECK_V2_HINT" desc="Safety Check settings page (chrome://settings/safetyCheck) gives users an overview over their safety status about the stored passwords, extensions, permisisons and security settings. If user types any command that would trigger omnibox pedal for safety check (e.g. typing safety check to omnnibox), a pedal will be shown on the omnibox. This string is the button text contents to suggest pedal action for safety check pedal.">
